# Cost by model / recent calls / gateway

### GET /api/cost/by-model
GET {{base_url}}/api/cost/by-model?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### GET /api/cost/recent - failed calls only
GET {{base_url}}/api/cost/recent?status=error&limit=50

### GET /api/cost/gateway - ai-manager usage for a month
GET {{base_url}}/api/cost/gateway?month=2026-11
